+// wins more"). Lets the unmodified open-source WindBot (ProjectIgnis fork, AGPL-3.0-or-later; per-deck scripted "executors") play one seat
+// of a duel run by OUR engine (dist/duel.mjs + the same ocgcore WASM build the site uses), while our AI plays the other seat.
